%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: GoToYuri
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: We arrive in Winterhold.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358671
    - rid: 4351268147175358672
    - rid: 4351268147175358673
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, you there! Guard!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ae40d73afae3081449025561e07b41e5, type: 2}
    dialog: Trouble?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, have you, or any of the other guards, seen a girl with long purple
      hair? Her name is Yuri.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ae40d73afae3081449025561e07b41e5, type: 2}
    dialog: A purple-haired girl?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ae40d73afae3081449025561e07b41e5, type: 2}
    dialog: Aye, I remember Leif mentioning a strange purple-haired girl.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358674
    - rid: 4351268147175358675
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ae40d73afae3081449025561e07b41e5, type: 2}
    dialog: He said she was running from the college, with a panicked look in her
      eye-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ae40d73afae3081449025561e07b41e5, type: 2}
    dialog: When she eventually stopped right on the border of town, and calmly turned
      around, walking into the inn.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, thanks.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358676
    - rid: 4351268147175358677
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ae40d73afae3081449025561e07b41e5, type: 2}
    dialog: No lollygaggin'.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358678
    - rid: 268099503569240126
    - rid: 4972360430703870072
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f59cc5badd24f6b43bbc333ef7a7d689, type: 2}
    dialog: Come on in, just stoked the fire-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358680
    - rid: 4351268147175358681
    - rid: 4351268147175358682
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Is there a girl with purple hair here?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f59cc5badd24f6b43bbc333ef7a7d689, type: 2}
    dialog: ... ah, <i>her</i>.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f59cc5badd24f6b43bbc333ef7a7d689, type: 2}
    dialog: There is a purple-haired girl here, yes.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358683
    - rid: 4351268147175358684
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f59cc5badd24f6b43bbc333ef7a7d689, type: 2}
    dialog: She drank <i>way</i> too much and made a real mess of things, so I dragged
      her down into the cellar.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358685
    - rid: 4351268147175358686
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh... what?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358687
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, well, is she still down there?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358688
    - rid: 4351268147175358689
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f59cc5badd24f6b43bbc333ef7a7d689, type: 2}
    dialog: Aye. If you're here to collect her, you can go right down the stairs
      behind me.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358690
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, okay.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358691
    - rid: 4351268147175358692
    - rid: 4351268147175358693
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The three of us make our way into the cellar and sure enough-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Yuri found.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358694
    - rid: 4351268147175358695
    - rid: 4351268147175358696
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, aren't we going to wake her up?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358698
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Not yet, no.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358699
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, uh, we still don't have a plan to address the... self-harm elephant
      in the room, do we?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268147175358700
    - rid: 4351268147175358701
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I mean, she literally booked it when you found her, Sayori-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I doubt she'd react well to an intervention.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Ehh... my head...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268167239598080
    - rid: 4351268167239598081
    - rid: 4351268167239598082
    - rid: 4351268167239598084
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: What time is it-?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268167239598085
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: '!!!'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268167239598086
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}, Monika, Sayori-'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Uuuuuuhh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268167239598087
    - rid: 4351268167239598089
    - rid: 4351268167239598090
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri tries to look around for some sort of exit, but thanks to the inn-keeper
      putting her by the booze barrels, she's got no escape.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268167239598091
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I guess we're doing this now!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, Yuri, what's goin' on...?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Is... is everything alright?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... Sayori said you, uh-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: No... stop pretending that you care...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Pretending that I care? What?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Sayori told you what I did! You should think I'm a freak!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268167239598143
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I cut myself! I've been cutting myself <i>for years</i>!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... well, that's not good!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri, I don't know if anyone's called you a freak before, but have we?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I mean, maybe Natsuki has, but I hope that we both know that her rudeness
      specifically comes from stress.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268167239598146
    - rid: 4351268167239598147
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So, I'm pretty sure that the only person in this room calling you a freak
      is, well, <i>you</i>.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268167239598148
    - rid: 4351268167239598149
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Right, you two?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268167239598150
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri, when I saw you... cutting yourself, I never thought you were a
      freak.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268167239598153
    - rid: 4351268167239598154
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I was scared and worried because <i>my friend</i> was hurting.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268167239598155
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: W-what...?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: We're your <i>friends</i>, Yuri. And we care about you. We really do.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268167239598156
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... do you want to talk about why you did that?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268167239598158
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: ... no... I don't want to...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268167239598159
    - rid: 4351268167239598160
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Oh come on...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I was willing to give the benefit of the doubt with the weird poem thing,
      but we've got a witness of you hurting yourself!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Why wouldn't you let us help you-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... the poem...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Oh God, is <i>this</i> what <i>The Racoon</i> was about?!?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Okay Yuri, I'm just going to put this out there...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You don't have to confirm or deny it, or even say anything, but-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I think I know the reason why.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: You do?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268167239598161
    - rid: 4351268167239598162
    - rid: 4351268167239598163
    - rid: 4351268167239598164
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, I don't why you started exactly, but...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You cut yourself because you're... addicted to it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268167239598165
    - rid: 4351268167239598166
    - rid: 4351268167239598167
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Which would explain your avoidant behavior regarding <i>The Raccoon</i>.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268167239598168
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'That''s why you feel so ashamed about it: to a certain extent you <i>know</i>
      that you shouldn''t do it, but you feel a compulsion that <i>demands</i> you
      do it.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268167239598169
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268167239598170
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... but I'm no psychologist.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: '"My theory" being correct or not wouldn''t change a thing.'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Because we would still care about you-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268167239598171
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: <i>And</i> you would still be worth caring about.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm sorry... I'm sorry... I'm sorry...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268167239598172
    - rid: 4351268167239598173
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I look at Sayori and flick my eyes toward Yuri.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268167239598174
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Sayori picks up on my queue and gives Yuri a gentle hug.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268167239598175
    - rid: 4351268167239598176
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: It's okay, Yuri. <i>We forgive you</i>...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268167239598177
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I was a little worried that Yuri would try and push Sayori away, but
      she seems to be accepting her care for now.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826790912
    - rid: 4351268190826790915
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: After around 10 minutes of gentle consoling, Yuri seems to have calmed
      down a little.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826790913
    - rid: 4351268190826790914
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: It's been a little awkward just standing around while Yuri cries into
      Sayori's shoulder...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So, uh...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki's been doing well.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826790968
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Without breaking her hold, Sayori looks up toward me.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826790969
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: That's good!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826790970
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: What has she been doing, exactly?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826790971
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, she beat up a guy, raided a tomb, and is currently fighting a bear.
      <i>I think</i>...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826790972
    - rid: 4351268190826790974
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Yuri lets out one of those little snort laughs.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826790975
    - rid: 4351268190826790976
    - rid: 4351268190826790977
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Not entirely sure why though, I didn't think it was <i>that</i> funny...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: In fact, thanks to how well she did raiding that tomb, she's now a full-fledged
      member of the Companions. All in a single day, no less!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826790978
    - rid: 4351268190826790979
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait, so she's a werewolf now?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826790980
    - rid: 4351268190826790981
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: No, not yet-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Yet? '
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826790983
    - rid: 4351268190826790984
    - rid: 4351268190826790985
    - rid: 4351268190826790986
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Much to our surprise, Yuri is now fully involved in our conversation.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Well, it's probably best not to stew on your negative feelings forever,
      so I guess that's a good sign.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826790987
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Becoming a werewolf is required in the original game, but it's also possible
      she'll find a way to avoid it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826790988
    - rid: 4351268190826790989
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So, I guess we'll see what happens sooner or later.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: What about you two? Your studies going well~?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826790990
    - rid: 4351268190826790991
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, the both of us were admitted into the college...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826790992
    - rid: 4351268190826790993
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I tried looking into forms of telepathy, but the book I found had little
      instructional value...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826790994
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: And the two of us explored Saarthal, and-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826790995
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: And it was horrible! There were so many draugr! And Mr. Tolfdir didn't
      help us at all!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826790996
    - rid: 4351268190826790997
    - rid: 4351268190826790998
    - rid: 4351268190826791000
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: He just sent us ahead on our own while he looked at some stupid coffins!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791001
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah... that's fair.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I guess I should let you know now, it's not gonna get any better.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791002
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Draugr are sort of a constant throughout the Skyrim experience, for better
      or worse.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Anyway, since you went through Saarthal, you had the Psijic guy talk
      to you?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791003
    - rid: 4351268190826791004
    - rid: 4351268190826791005
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, yeah... so did he actually freeze time, or what?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791006
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I don't remember that...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791007
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Now that's interesting...!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Well there''s you proof that he froze time, Sayori: Yuri didn''t notice
      him at all.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791009
    - rid: 4351268190826791010
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: He said some weird stuff about me being judgy, or something...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791008
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... really? I thought he was talking about <i>judging</i> you based on
      how you handle the Eye of Magnus debacle.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: The Eye of Magnus? What's that?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791011
    - rid: 4351268190826791013
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: The big blue ball that you two should've found down at the end of Saarthal,
      the one with the fancy draugr guarding it.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It's basically going to be the major plot macguffin for the rest of the
      questline, and Ancano's going to use it to be really evil.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, how?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791014
    - rid: 4351268190826791015
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well the Eye of Magnus is an artifact of genuinely incomprehensible magical
      power.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: If you find a way to wield it, you can do <i>serious</i> damage, possibly
      alter the laws of physics entirely.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791016
    - rid: 4351268190826791017
    - rid: 4351268190826791018
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Which, as it turns out, is very attractive for a megalomaniacal elf Nazi.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, how do we stop him?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791019
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You'll need the Staff of Magnus, which is in a extensive ruin called
      Labyrinthian, if Ancano actually gets started on his machinations.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791020
    - rid: 4351268190826791021
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: But, you'll have to convince the Arch-Mage somehow to give you the door
      handle to that place, which might be challenging.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Besides, your guys' next quest is to go get those books back, right?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791022
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Get books back, {mc}? What do you mean?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791026
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: That's the quest after Saarthal; you go save a guy from some rival mage
      school to get books back relating to the history of the ruins themselves.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Pretty sure the Arch-Mage tells you to do that after you let him know
      about the Eye of Magnus on Tolfdir's behalf...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: He didn't say anything like that, he just said that what we found was
      "interesting" and told us to excuse him while he left.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791023
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: First Farkas, and now Savos are going off-script?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791027
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: It'd be one thing if we were prompting them to act differently, but they
      sort of just... are.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... in the original game, the Arch-Mage is a lot more passive so...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791024
    - rid: 4351268190826791025
    - rid: 4351268190826791028
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm not <i>entirely</i> sure what you should do next...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791030
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I guess you two should, first and foremost, keep in mind that the Eye
      of Magnus is dangerous.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791029
    - rid: 4351268190826791031
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: If Ancano gets too comfy with it, intervene in some way; whether that
      be telling a teacher, or convincing the Arch-Mage to let you into Labyrinthian.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You could also look into the missing books thing, even if there really
      isn't anything you can learn from that, you'd still be helping somebody.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... yeah.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Also, have you two learned any cool spells yet?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791032
    - rid: 4351268190826791033
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Not really, no...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791034
    - rid: 4351268190826791035
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I mean, you two are at <i>the</i> magic school in Skyrim... so you should
      probably take that opportunity.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Wouldn't want Sayori to become Arch-Mage and not know any actual spells,
      heh.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 'Assuming that she''s the main character for the questline because the
      mer from the Psijic Order talked to her specifically, and not the both of them. '
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I think that's everything... ready to go, Monika?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791036
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: You're leaving already?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791037
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yep. We're going caving!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791038
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Safe travels, you two.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791050
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You too, you... two...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268190826791051
